#: manual/api/adapter.md:35
msgid "There is nothing to import from `adapter`. To adapt your own AST, import the packages that hold the trait and the generic algorithms:"
msgstr "`adapter` 中没有可导入的内容。要适配你自己的 AST，请导入包含该 trait 和泛型算法的包："

#: manual/api/adapter.md:47
msgid "What the tests check"
msgstr "测试检查的内容"

#: manual/api/adapter.md:49
msgid "The test file `src/adapter/poly_adapter_wbtest.mbt` uses a private AST with four node kinds: integer literals (projected as `Opaque`), variables, an n-ary sum node (projected as `Apply`) and a scope node (projected as `Bind`). It checks that"
msgstr "测试文件 `src/adapter/poly_adapter_wbtest.mbt` 使用一个包含四种节点的私有 AST：整数字面量（投影为 `Opaque`）、变量、n 元求和节点（投影为 `Apply`）以及作用域节点（投影为 `Bind`）。它检查"

#: manual/api/adapter.md:54
msgid "`GenericSubstitution::apply_once` substitutes simultaneously and in one pass: $\\{x \\mapsto y,\\ y \\mapsto 2\\}$ applied to $x + y$ gives $y + 2$;"
msgstr "`GenericSubstitution::apply_once` 同时且一趟完成代换：将 $\\{x \\mapsto y,\\ y \\mapsto 2\\}$ 作用于 $x + y$ 得到 $y + 2$；"

#: manual/api/adapter.md:56
msgid "substitution leaves variables outside its domain in place (partial evaluation);"
msgstr "代换保留其定义域之外的变量不变（部分求值）；"

#: manual/api/adapter.md:58
msgid "`generic_top_down_once` finds a redex inside an argument, rebuilds the parent through the trait constructors, and reports the path `[ApplyArgument(0)]`."
msgstr "`generic_top_down_once` 在某个参数内部找到可约式，通过 trait 构造器重建父节点，并报告路径 `[ApplyArgument(0)]`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "core API"
msgstr "core API"

#: manual/api/core.md:5
msgid "The `core` package defines the vocabulary that every other package of `type_theory` shares: variable names, fresh-name generation, ordered scopes, telescopes and finite renamings. All values are immutable: every operation that \"changes\" a value returns a new one and leaves its argument untouched. The mathematics behind these definitions is in the [core design](../design/core.md)."
msgstr "`core` 包定义了 `type_theory` 中所有其他包共享的基本词汇：变量名、新名字生成、有序作用域、伸缩式（telescope）以及有限重命名。所有值都是不可变的：每个“改变”值的操作都返回一个新值，并保持其参数不变。这些定义背后的数学见 [core 设计](../design/core.md)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:13
#: manual/api/debruijn.md:16
#: manual/api/eval.md:14
#: manual/api/rewrite.md:19
#: manual/api/stlc.md:17
#: manual/api/substitution.md:15
#: manual/api/syntax.md:16
